<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher, broad  demand. Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-250 lbs	    57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 47.00.</p>
<p>US   1-3  All weights    46.00-47.00</p>
</text>
